flowchart TD
  Start([Open PPSEB Lab]) --> Params[Set parameters]
  Params --> Init["POST /api/init"]
  Init --> Valid{Parameters valid?}
  Valid -- No --> Error[Show validation error]
  Error --> Params
  Valid -- Yes --> Root[Store root keys in session]
  Root --> Choose{Choose activity}

  Choose --> Happy[Happy Path]
  Happy --> Encrypt["Encrypt keyword + create trapdoor"]
  Encrypt --> Verify{Verify matches?}
  Verify -- Yes --> Decrypt[Decrypt record for response]
  Verify -- No --> Reject[Return no plaintext]
  Decrypt --> Trace[Render result and trace]
  Reject --> Trace

  Choose --> KGA[KGA tab]
  KGA --> Guess["Encrypt dictionary guesses with public data"]
  Guess --> GuessMatch{Public Verify matches?}
  GuessMatch -- No --> Guess
  GuessMatch -- Yes --> Recovered[Display recovered keyword]

  Choose --> Forward[Forward Security tab]
  Forward --> Norms[Measure transformed-basis norms]
  Norms --> Verdict[Derive verdict from measured evidence]

  Choose --> Spec[Spec Defect tab]
  Spec --> Paper[Run printed circular KeyExt]
  Spec --> Corrected[Run corrected chain and check membership]
